<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed attackers killed at least 60 Orthodox Christians in two separate incidents in Oromia, while violence in Gambella left 12 dead and more than 80 injured, according to MSF. Senior Tigray Military Commander Major General Yohannes was captured near the Eritrean border. The UN reports that over 35,000 Ethiopians have fled across the Kenya border amid the conflict. The UCDP recorded 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE5kY2FoWW93cVFGTU1oTXROMnlqOEVIVG9hOXdlTW5jLUtBNFd2NEVDVG1oNjJ1Q2NQdEhUd05RaHh3RFV0VTdZM2R6Y2VxNm9nVnpqeXk2eFlRZWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breitbart News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPT0pRREk2Y0Y3bmlsUDdDaGtBNTZzOWZrN25lcDlFMkRUajViVWtTa3hwN18wX3htS0VRYlg3MlhUMV9UYjMzWmJqdURsVDlqeXZLU3dxNkdMeFhIVHg5QlQ0NXBjdklWU0NKN1JUS1dGUGwweUk1REFCWEJhdC0tVTh6REVVR2hya2dsMVRDdmd2Tnk2WFhHWVBuXzdseUJTRUFiQ2lJODR2WmU3bFpwY19ydzFMdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borkena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQdDc1UHhfQVJXZWpHWE9sVG9BSWh6am5iQ2prbVhjWm9uaWNUVjlram9TajJWRkxjQmNnSXEzc1poc3ZMSGtPeGZVUGtQUTBDeFpuUUt4ZWhqcThhRG4tZGxkaGZuNnZzT2IzUmNwbThGNFNRUVhUNkt0elFxUjBNeUVuOUU5dTlzRlM1Q3dNdkczOC1wTGxhRHpyOFFLVDFrTjVyOU9LejlKYXh0SmY4UmN3R09Ndw?oc=5&quot;&gt;GhanaWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNd0pGakhJMVRZUF84M0xaeE8zd3lHS1ZXMW1ONGZrQl9LNVVsNVRhNHJuaGlBUld4aTVOSUFpZmxGN0FPYnB4X1J1dmZSQVRQMnlIUnp6elZoQ0l2SWM0MWJLWGl3eTRFSTIxQ1RFTFJVTTh5Qm9FYXVZTS1kajZHb0FLWE1uSHFLbmtHamVRdEhzQkhNcjFpRzRNaUM3c0p4U0hVcEltTXo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Biblical Recorder&